# ------------------------------------------------------------------ build output
build/
*.class
*.dex
build.ps1.log

# -------------------------------------------------------------------- signing key
# The keystore holds a PRIVATE signing key. It is deliberately not published:
# anyone holding it could sign an APK that Android would accept as an update to
# this app. tools/build.ps1 regenerates one automatically when it is missing --
# see README, section 七 (重新编译).
keystore/

# ------------------------------------------------ reverse-engineering scratch data
# Headless-Chrome user-data directories created by the probe scripts under
# research/. These are browser caches worth hundreds of MB each.
research/chrome-*/
research/*/chrome-profile*/

# Bundled binaries captured alongside the network traces.
research/capture*/bin/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copies of the site's own code and markup are not redistributed here:
#   research/js/          - JavaScript bundles downloaded from yangshipin.cn
#   research/home-dom.html - the page's rendered HTML
# Both can be re-fetched with research/harvest.js.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
research/js/
research/home-dom.html

# apksigner writes a v4 signature side file next to the APK; this build only
# uses v1/v2/v3, so the file is unused.
*.idsig

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Screenshots and recorded transport-stream segments.
# Two reasons: they are large, and they contain CCTV broadcast frames, which are
# not ours to redistribute. Re-create screenshots by running the app.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
research/**/*.png
research/*.png
research/**/*.ts
research/**/*.mp4
research/**/*.m3u8

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.bak
